# Ado's theorem
%%%
tag := "Chapter2/Remark2.9.3"
number := false
%%%
*Remark 2.9.3.* *Ado's theorem* says that any finite dimensional Lie algebra is a Lie subalgebra of $`\mathfrak{gl}(V)` for a suitable finite dimensional vector space $`V`.

